response:
The threat activity tracked as UAC-0113 (associated with Sandworm) targeted Ukrainian media organizations via phishing emails with malicious attachments. The document СПИСОК_посилань_на_інтерактивні_карти.docx downloads and executes update.html, which in turn downloads and executes 2.txt, delivering the CrescentImp malware. The IP addresses 185.80.92.143, 72.167.223.219, and 203.96.191.70 host respective payload files.

